Bianca, an active member on my community and local expert, has shared this expert- tip of setting in for a memorable holiday. Many things should be done before leaving for a break, including:
- Make sure all garbage has been removed or contained so that it does not attract rodents, ants, and flies;
- Ensure the house and property are secure and free from clutter such as dead leaves and tree limbs;
- Keep doors and windows shut or locked at night and when away from the house;
- Check and replace air filters and clean all vents and heating/ ventilation fans;
- Test all lights and smoke alarms and make a plan on how your friends and neighbors can check your house and its surroundings, including your yard and garage.
All the best,
-Annika
